{"id":5273,"date":"2020-04-01T05:50:45","date_gmt":"2020-04-01T05:50:45","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/jammindjs.net\/?page_id=5273"},"modified":"2026-06-04T19:33:41","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T19:33:41","slug":"jammin-djs-videos","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/jammin-djs-videos\/","title":{"rendered":"JAMMIN&#8217; Videos"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\t<h2>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs Videos<\/h2>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs videos give you a quick look at the energy, music, lighting, production, and guest experience we bring to real events. From weddings and Bar and Bat Mitzvahs to school dances, trivia nights, photo booth events, and special effects, these videos help you see what JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can add to your celebration.<\/p>\n<p>Every event has a different feel. Because of that, our team customizes the music, MC style, lighting, timeline, and entertainment options around the client, venue, crowd, and event goals.<\/p>\n<h3>See JAMMIN&#8217; DJs in Action<\/h3>\n<p>Browse the videos below to see examples of our wedding entertainment, school dance productions, mitzvah parties, JAMMIN&#8217; Sparks, trivia events, and photo booth experiences. In addition, you can visit our YouTube channel for more recent event videos and entertainment content.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/user\/jammindjs303\/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Watch more JAMMIN&#8217; DJs videos on YouTube<\/a><\/p>\n<h3>JAMMIN&#8217; Weddings Demo<\/h3>\n<p>See how JAMMIN&#8217; DJs helps couples create smooth receptions, packed dance floors, polished announcements, and memorable wedding moments.<\/p>\n<p><video controls width=\"100%\"><source src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/JAMMIN-DJs-Wedding2020-demo2-1-5e842ba3a63c0.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\"\/>Your browser does not support the video tag.<\/video><\/p>\n<h3>JAMMIN&#8217; Sparks<\/h3>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; Sparks can create a dramatic effect for grand entrances, first dances, dance floor moments, and special event highlights where permitted by the venue and local regulations.<\/p>\n<p><video controls width=\"100%\"><source src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/Wedding-Sparks-Demo-5e84300a50062.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\"\/>Your browser does not support the video tag.<\/video><\/p>\n<h3>JAMMIN&#8217; Schools Demo<\/h3>\n<p>Our school dance videos show the sound, lighting, music, and student energy JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can bring to proms, homecomings, pep rallies, winter formals, and student celebrations.<\/p>\n<p><video controls width=\"100%\"><source src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/JAMMINSCHO2020DEMO-5e842ffa16c63.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\"\/>Your browser does not support the video tag.<\/video><\/p>\n<h3>JAMMIN&#8217; Trivia<\/h3>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; Trivia gives restaurants, bars, corporate events, and private parties a fun way to keep guests involved. Our hosts keep the game moving, explain the rules, and create a lively event experience.<\/p>\n<p><video controls width=\"100%\"><source src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/Jammin-TriviaNew-5e842fe53ecba.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\"\/>Your browser does not support the video tag.<\/video><\/p>\n<h3>JAMMIN&#8217; Sparks Demo<\/h3>\n<p>This demo shows another example of how sparks can add visual excitement to weddings, mitzvahs, school events, corporate events, and private celebrations when the effect is approved for the venue.<\/p>\n<p><video controls width=\"100%\"><source src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/Copy-of-Jammin-Sparks-Demo-5e842fba70fae.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\"\/>Your browser does not support the video tag.<\/video><\/p>\n<h3>JAMMIN&#8217; Bar &amp; Bat Mitzvah<\/h3>\n<p>Our Bar and Bat Mitzvah videos show how JAMMIN&#8217; DJs combines music, MC services, games, dancers, lighting, and party flow to keep kids engaged and adults included.<\/p>\n<p><video controls width=\"100%\"><source src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/2020-Jammin-Mitzvah-Commercial-5e842f980a0f1.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\"\/>Your browser does not support the video tag.<\/video><\/p>\n<h3>JAMMIN&#8217; Mitzvah &amp; Photo Booth<\/h3>\n<p>This video highlights mitzvah entertainment and photo booth options that give guests more ways to participate, laugh, take pictures, and enjoy the celebration.<\/p>\n<p><video controls width=\"100%\"><source src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/2020-Mitzvah-Photo-Booth-5e894f442c6a8.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\"\/>Your browser does not support the video tag.<\/video><\/p>\n<h3>Plan Your Event Entertainment<\/h3>\n<p>If you are planning a wedding, Bar or Bat Mitzvah, school dance, corporate event, trivia night, photo booth rental, or private celebration, JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can help you build the right entertainment package.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get an Event Entertainment Quote<\/a><\/p>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs Videos JAMMIN&#8217; DJs videos give you a quick look at the energy, music, lighting, production, and guest experience we bring to real events. From weddings and Bar and Bat Mitzvahs to school dances, trivia nights, photo booth events, and special effects, these videos help you see what JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can add to your&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5273","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs Videos | Event Entertainment<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"JAMMIN\u2019 DJs videos featuring w